"screen sharing, or end the conference."
msgstr "操作员可以锁定房间,哑巴参与者,禁用相机,管理屏幕共享,或者结束会议."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/live/landing_live/features.html.heex:630
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Over 50 commands with smart autocomplete."
msgstr "超过50个有智能自动完成的指令."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/live/landing_live/faq.html.heex:32
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"P2P (peer-to-peer) means data goes directly between users without passing "
"through the chat server. Retro Hex Chat uses WebRTC P2P for private calls, "
"file transfers, and multiplayer game sessions. The server helps users find "
"each other (signaling), then the private session runs browser-to-browser "
"when the network allows it."
msgstr ""
"P2P(peer-to-peer)是指数据在用户之间直接传递,而不通过聊天服务器. Retro Hex Chat使用WebRTC "
"P2P进行私人通话,文件传输,以及多人游戏会话. 服务器帮助用户互相查找(信号),然后当网络允许时,私人会话会运行浏览器到浏览器."

